{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01749","headline":"杂曲歌辞 空城雀 · 王建","name":"杂曲歌辞 空城雀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空城雀，何不飞来人家住？\n空城无人种禾黍。\n土间生子草间长，满地蓬蒿幸无主。\n近村虽有高树枝，雨中无食长苦饥。\n八月小儿夹弓箭，家家畏我田头飞。\n但能不出空城里，秋时百草皆有子。\n黄口黄口莫啾啾，长尔得成无横死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01749.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01749","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}